---
const hbms = ['HBM', 'HBM', 'HBM', 'HBM'];
---

<section class="not-prose my-8 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-cyan-900/5 dark:bg-slate-950">
  <div class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-50 via-white to-amber-50 p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-cyan-950/35 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-amber-950/20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-300">CoWoS Cross Section</p>
    <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">AI 芯片不是一颗芯片，而是一座小城市</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-5 items-end gap-2">
        {hbms.slice(0, 2).map((hbm, index) => (
          <div class="space-y-1">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4].map(() => <div class="h-5 rounded bg-emerald-300 shadow-sm dark:bg-emerald-400"></div>)}
            <p class="text-center font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-200">{hbm} {index + 1}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-300 to-blue-500 p-5 text-center text-slate-950 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,0.35)]">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase">Logic Die</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black">GPU</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold">N3 / N4</p>
        </div>
        {hbms.slice(2).map((hbm, index) => (
          <div class="space-y-1">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4].map(() => <div class="h-5 rounded bg-emerald-300 shadow-sm dark:bg-emerald-400"></div>)}
            <p class="text-center font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-200">{hbm} {index + 3}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-cyan-300/30 bg-cyan-100 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold text-cyan-900 dark:bg-cyan-950/50 dark:text-cyan-100">
        Silicon Interposer / RDL + LSI Bridge：让 GPU 与 HBM 以超宽总线贴身互连
      </div>
      <div class="mt-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-300/35 bg-amber-100 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold text-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950/40 dark:text-amber-100">
        Organic Substrate：连接主板、电源与外部 I/O
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">HBM 必须贴近 GPU</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">距离越远，带宽越低、功耗越高。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Interposer 是瓶颈</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">中介层、键合、测试吞吐量决定 AI GPU 交付速度。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">CoWoS-L 越来越重要</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">更大封装、更多 HBM，是 Rubin / 下一代 ASIC 的方向。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
